# S14p, room owner o (k2 without flag 505, stag0101's matb01 hint panel; the room story starts from that card:
# seed_story): plays into its lobby (a solo hub instance) and stays there while the guest plays stag0101. When the
# guest's panel sets 505, the server merges it at once (the owner is in the room) and sends the new revision to every
# other member: o's confirmed room story has 505, its engine not (the story never changes mid-stage, SEAMLESS.md 8.5).
# The next barrier of o's instance (the lobby's matz00 into stagml12) brings it.
campaign until stage=stagml11
talk until control,frames>=60
log in the lobby
idle until roomflag:505=1 fail flag:505=1
log 505 in the room story
idle until frames>=180 fail flag:505=1
log 505 not mid-stage
mat matz00 yes until stage=stagml12,control
log in stagml12
idle until frames>=60 fail flag:505=0
log 505 after the barrier
idle until frames>=60
